    do not exclude any mandatory consumer rights or liability that cannot lawfully be excluded.
  </p>

  <h2>Stopping use and changes to these terms</h2>
  <p>
    You can stop using Gleaner at any time by removing it from your assistant and disconnecting
    tools through the relevant provider's controls. Your open-source license rights remain governed
    by the applicable license. Updates to these terms will appear on this page with a revised date
    and apply prospectively; they do not change the license of software already released.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    For questions about Gleaner or these terms, use the{' '}
    <a href="https://github.com/shawn-sandy/gleaner/issues">Gleaner issue tracker</a> or the contact options
